{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/15/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんずちゃんず"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/14/2177743/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はねねといっぱいしゃべったー\nねねちゃーんねねちゃーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねねといるとにやにやとおしゃべりが\n止まらなーい助けてー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/14/2177743/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいのブログ回数は\n意識してますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/14/2177743/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまい！\nそんなに意識してなかったけど\n回数一緒くらいですよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/14/2177743/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/14/2177743/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そろそろテストの時期に\nなるのかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/14/2177743/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん泣\nがんばりまーす！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/14/2177743/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エッグスンシングスじゃない\nパンケーキも、メンバーと\n食べに行くの？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/14/2177743/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだメンバーとbills行ったよ！\n乃木メンはパンケーキ\nだいすきなんだよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/14/2177743/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服とか制服のシャツ\n第一ボタンとめる系女子ですか?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/14/2177743/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とめる系かな。\nシャツすき"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/14/2177743/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも暑かったりするときは開ける！\nバランス考えて一個開けたりもするよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はテスト勉強の日！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}